[[File:Userrankicon.png|thumb|User Rank icon|alt=UR]]
The '''User Rank''' (or '''UR''') counter is unlocked after completing [[Korea (Empire of Cats)|Korea/Nagasaki]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. It first appeared in [[Version 3.0 Update|Version 3.0]] of the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]] and [[Version 2.0 Update|2.0.1]] of the [[The Battle Cats|English version]]. This feature provides various rewards to the player, from an increase in unit level caps, to usable item bonuses such as [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Cat Tickets]], [[Battle Items]], or [[Catseye]]s. The User Rank counter is found in the top-left corner of the [[Cat Base Menu]].

To get the rewards, players have to reach certain ranks, which are the sum of the levels of all [[Cat Units]] you have. Each time you level up a cat, through XP, unlocking new cats and through  bonus '+ levels' when using a cat you already have, the rank is increased by 1. For every increment of 100 user rank reached, a "Rank Up Sale" offer will be presented where [[Cat Food]], XP, and a supply drop of multiple items (which are based off of the user's progress in the game) can be purchased at discounted prices. Early rewards at 100 through 700 include Battle Items and [[Cat Capsule#Normal Cat Capsule|Cat Tickets]]; 800 is a [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Cat Ticket]]. 900 through to 1410 increase the level caps of [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare]], [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare]], [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare]] and [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare]] units to 30. At rank 1600, [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cats]] can be upgraded to level 30.

Once a player has reached the requirement of rewards, there will be a flashing exclamation "Pts!" sign on the user rank button to notify player there is a reward available. Viewing the user's status will not be available until the user claims the reward. Claiming the reward will also award the player a [[Leadership]], which is an item that fully recovers the equivalent of the amount of maximum energy that the user currently has (can exceed the maximum energy limit).

==Before completing Chapter 2 of Empire of Cats==
Initial level cap (+ value):
*[[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]]: Level 10+19
*[[Upgrade Menu|Base Upgrades]]: Level 10+10
*[[:Category:Special Cats|Special/EX Cats]]: Level 10
*[[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cats]]: Level 10+9
*[[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cats]]: Level 10+9
*[[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]]: Level 10+9
*[[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cats]]: Level 10+9

==After completing Chapter 2 of Empire of Cats==
Initial level cap (+ value):
*[[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]]: Level 20+19
*[[Upgrade Menu|Base Upgrades]]: Level 20+10
*[[:Category:Special Cats|Special/EX Cats]]: Level 20
*[[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cats]]: Level 20+9
*[[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cats]]: Level 20+9
*[[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]]: Level 20+9
*[[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cats]]: Level 20+9

